      "description": "The checks that made a run's row numbers approximate, in runs whose row numbers are approximate. **Reason** is the check's `row.attribution_note`. A check that ended in `ERROR` has no note: it may hide failed rows. Click a trace ID to open the run. See [Approximate row counts](https://github.com/govtech-data-practice/vowl/blob/main/docs/dq-metrics/understanding-metrics.md#approximate-row-counts).",
      "datasource": {
